      "writtenOn": "2025-10-08T15:22:21Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I am consistently hitting this issue while provisioning YubiHSM 2 with `start.sh` after setting different passwords etc. and going through all the steps, this is what I\u0027m getting:\n\n```\n##################################################\n### GENERATING KEYS: avb\n##################################################\n# KEY: vbmeta\nUsing slot 0 with a present token (0x0)\nerror: PKCS11 function C_Login failed: rv \u003d CKR_ARGUMENTS_BAD (0x7)\nAborting.\n```\n\nWhen using `password` as the password in the setup, everything works.\nIf you have any hints they would be helpful, I\u0027ll continue reading and debugging anyway.",
